  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Hyper-G is a high-performance shaped co-polyester string engineered to combine explosive power, extreme spin, strong ball bite and dependable control. Its proprietary chemical formula and high-powered polyester filament construction create the signature Hyper-G response, while TruTension Technology is designed to support lasting performance. Available in seven gauges from 1.05 to 1.35 mm, Hyper-G covers an unusually broad range of playing styles, from maximum spin and feel in ultra-thin gauges to maximum durability and stability in thicker versions.",

    "zh": "Solinco Hyper-G 是 Solinco 最具代表性的高性能异形共聚酯球线之一，核心特点是爆发力量、极高旋转、强烈咬球以及稳定控制。其专有化学配方与高性能聚酯纤维结构形成 Hyper-G 标志性的击球反馈，同时 TruTension™ Technology 用于提升长期表现的一致性。产品提供从 1.05 到 1.35 毫米共七种线径，覆盖范围非常广：超细线径强调极致旋转和手感，粗线径则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

